Description: Wild OS Task Manager
 Task Manager shows what is running and how hard the computer is working,
 laid out the way Windows 11 Task Manager is: apps and background
 processes with End task, live performance graphs for the processor,
 memory, disks, network, graphics and Windows mode, the apps that start
 when you sign in, Windows apps and services.
 .
 Its numbers come from the system monitor service the desktop already
 runs (ksystemstats) and its process library (libksysguard).
